        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ciöt Kuɔth kɛ Yɛdh-ki-el ala gök",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jɔw ruac kɛ ɣä wëë i̱, “Gat ran, jiecni rɔ cuɔ̱ŋ, ɣän bä ruac kɛ ji̱.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min cɛ ruac kɛ ɣä, cu Yiëë Kuɔth ben rɛydä kä cuɛ ɣä jakä cuŋ kɛ ciökä, kä cua̱ jɛ liŋ ruacɛ kɛ ɣä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ruac kɛ ɣä wëë i̱, “Gat ran, ɣän ja̱kä ji̱ kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, ja̱kä ji̱ kä do̱r mi ci kac raar, mi ci ɣä lo̱k. Kɛn kɛ gua̱nikiɛn cikɛ ɣä duer duer mëëdan amäni walɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn nɛy tin ja̱kä ji̱ kä kɛ kɛ nɛy ti jiäk ti bum wuɔ̱thkiɛn. Ɣän ja̱kä ji̱ kä kɛ, kɛ ɣöö bikɛ jiök i̱, ‘Mɛmɛ ɛ min ci Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial ɛ lar.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A cäŋ liŋ kɛn ɛ kiɛ /cikɛn ɛ liŋ, (kɛ ɣöö kɛ ji̱ thuɔk duëël mi ci kac raar), bikɛ jɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö ci gök kɔŋ te rɛydiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱n lö raan /cu dual kɛ kɛ, kä /cu dual kɛ rieetkiɛn. A cäŋ ca ji̱ go̱l ɛ thil lual kɛnɛ kuiy kä cieŋi rɛy jiɛthni, /cu dual kɛ rieetkiɛn. Kä /cu dual kɛ guecdiɛn, kɛ ɣöö kɛ ji̱ thuɔk duëël mi ci kac raar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji̱n bi rieetkä la̱t kɛ, a cäŋ liŋ kɛn ɛ kiɛ /cikɛn ɛ liŋ, kɛ ɣöö kɛ ji̱ thuɔk duëël mi ci kac raar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Duundɛ ɣöö, ji̱n gat ran liŋ min la̱rä ji̱. /Cu bi lɛ kac raar ce̱tkɛ jɛn thok duëël ɛ ci kac raar ɛ. Lɛp thokdu kä cam min ka̱mä ji̱.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min cä guic cua̱ tet nɛn lotdɛ ni ɣä, kä te warɛgak mi ca gɔ̱r thi̱n rɛydɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ jɛ ɣär nhiamdä, ca jɛ gɔ̱r nhiamdɛ kɛnɛ jɔkdɛ. Kä tin ca gɔ̱r rɛydɛ kɛ rieet jiɛthä lɔaac kɛnɛ wiee kɛ pa̱r.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
